      "lastChecked": "2026-09-06",
      "staleAfterDays": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "needsVerification": false,
      "note": "Fetched live per location/nationality; each alert shows its issuing source, updated date and link. Cached on-device with its fetch time. Weather alerts require the WeatherKit capability (see fastlane/.env.example). Canadian advisories use the official open-data feed and preserve its regional qualifications and publication date. Contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – Canada. Failed or malformed provider responses retain the last good advisory and its original saved date."
